---
import PolicyPage from '../components/PolicyPage.astro';
const sections = [['use', 'Using this website'], ['ip', 'Ownership and quoting'], ['content', 'Content and accuracy'], ['sample', 'Sample and demonstration content'], ['links', 'Links to other sites'], ['submit', 'What you send us'], ['liability', 'Liability'], ['law', 'Governing law'], ['contact', 'Contact']].map(([id, title]) => ({ id, title }));
---
<PolicyPage title="Terms of Use" lede="The rules for using this website, in plain language." sections={sections}>
  <h2 id="use">Using this website</h2>
  <p>You may use this website for lawful purposes. Please do not try to disrupt it, gain unauthorized access, or use automated tools in a way that harms its performance.</p>
  <h2 id="ip">Ownership and quoting</h2>
  <p>The content on this website, including text, design, data presentation and the Native Media name and logo, belongs to Native Media or its licensors. You may quote short extracts with clear credit and a link to the original page. Other uses, including republishing, need written permission.</p>
  <h2 id="content">Content and accuracy</h2>
  <p>We aim to be accurate and to show our sources. We separate reporting, research-based analysis, opinion, institutional statements and sponsored content, and we label each (see the <a href="/editorial-policy">Editorial Policy</a> and <a href="/research-policy">Research Policy</a>). Information on this website is for general information. It is not legal, financial, investment or diplomatic advice. Please check original sources before relying on any figure.</p>
  <p>Reports and research from other organizations that we feature remain the work of their authors and publishers. Featuring them does not mean we endorse them, and rights in them stay with their owners.</p>
  <h2 id="sample">Sample and demonstration content</h2>
  <p>Some pages use clearly labelled demonstration or illustrative sample content, including charts, maps and stories. It is not real information and must not be quoted or relied on.</p>
  <h2 id="links">Links to other sites</h2>
  <p>We link to other websites for your convenience. We do not control them and are not responsible for their content.</p>
  <h2 id="submit">What you send us</h2>
  <p>Information you send through our forms is handled under our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>. Please do not send confidential or sensitive material through the forms. Sending us an idea, proposal or guest suggestion does not create a contract or any obligation on either side.</p>
  <h2 id="liability">Liability</h2>
  <p>The website is provided “as it is”. To the extent the law allows, Native Media is not liable for loss arising from using the website or relying on its content. Nothing here limits liability that cannot be limited by law.</p>
  <h2 id="law">Governing law</h2>
  <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the United Republic of Tanzania, and any dispute about them is for the courts of Tanzania.</p>
  <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about these terms: please use the <a href="/contact/general-inquiries">contact form</a>.</p>
</PolicyPage>
